// title: CloudApp Privilege OAuth Grant
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Cloud Apps
// tables: CloudAppEvents
// purpose: CloudApp Privilege OAuth Grant
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/CloudApp%20Privilege%20OAuth%20Grant.kql
